OpenArm teleoperation with Adamo

This distribution includes the OpenArm robot model and mesh assets from
Enactic's openarm_description project:
https://github.com/enactic/openarm_description
Copyright 2025 Enactic, Inc.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The robot description is the generated bimanual v10 URDF used by the deployed
OpenArm controller. Mesh references were changed from deployment-specific
absolute paths to paths relative to the URDF. The mesh assets are unmodified.

Legacy XR CDR test fixtures originate from the Adamo SDK:
https://github.com/adamo-tech/adamo
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Waveshare's libcontrolcanfd.so is a separately installed vendor dependency
and is not included in this distribution.
